 ## Core Features & Screens
 
 1. **Splash Screen** ΓÇö Entry point with the WaitLess brand and tagline.
-2. **Home** ΓÇö Search functionality, browse by sector (hospitality, finance, retail, entertainment), and view live nearby previews.
-3. **Nearby List** ΓÇö View places with live crowd badges, estimated wait times, and confidence scores.
-4. **Place Details** ΓÇö Get deep insights on estimated wait ranges, best-time-to-visit, and a smart lower-wait alternative recommendation.
-5. **Report Crowd** ΓÇö One-tap reporting interface to submit live crowd levels (Low / Medium / High), instantly updating the global live data status.
+2. **Real-time Location & Map** ΓÇö Uses device geolocation and Leaflet maps to plot nearby points of interest via real-world APIs (Overpass/Foursquare).
+3. **Category Filtering** ΓÇö Browse nearby places by dynamically filtering categories (e.g., Food, Entertainment, Shopping).
+4. **Nearby List & Predictions** ΓÇö View places with live crowd badges, estimated wait times, and confidence scores.
+5. **Place Details** ΓÇö Get deep insights on estimated wait ranges, best-time-to-visit, and a smart lower-wait alternative recommendation.
+6. **Report Crowd** ΓÇö One-tap reporting interface to submit live crowd levels (Low / Medium / High), instantly updating the global live data status.
 
